Project Documentation PhaseProject Documentation Phase – PocketSmart AI: Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant

The Project Documentation Phase involves preparing complete records of the PocketSmart AI project. It explains the project objectives, design, development, testing, and final results.

1. Introduction

The documentation describes PocketSmart AI, a smart budget and recommendation assistant designed to help users manage their personal finances.

2. Problem Statement

Many users find it difficult to track daily expenses and control unnecessary spending. PocketSmart AI provides a simple system for monitoring expenses and managing budgets.

3. Objectives

To track daily income and expenses.

To categorize spending.

To set and monitor budgets.

To analyze spending patterns.

To provide personalized recommendations.

To help users improve their saving habits.


4. System Requirements

The documentation includes the hardware and software requirements needed to run the application.

Software:

HTML, CSS, JavaScript

Python/Node.js

MySQL

Web browser


Hardware:

Computer or smartphone

Minimum 4 GB RAM

Internet connection


